@startuml
title Project A - Training Workflow (High Level)

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}

|Data Preparation|
start
:Collect IQA datasets\n(LIVE, CSIQ, OHR-Bench);
:Generate synthetic degradations\n(blur, noise, compression);
:Create annotation labels\n(quality scores, defect types);
:Split train/val/test sets;

|Teacher Training|
:Initialize ResNet-50 backbone\n(ImageNet pretrained);
:Add multi-head IQA classifier\n(blur, noise, contrast, skew, compression);
:Train on labeled IQA data\n(Modal GPU: T4/A10);
:Validate on held-out set\n(target: mAP > 0.88);
if (Teacher passes\nvalidation?) then (yes)
  :Export Teacher checkpoint;
else (no)
  :Tune hyperparameters;
  :Retrain;
endif

|Knowledge Distillation|
:Initialize ResNet-18 Student\n(random or pretrained);
:Run Teacher forward passes\n(collect soft targets);
:Train Student with:\nL = α·KL(T||S) + β·CE(hard);
:Temperature scaling T=4.0;
if (Student meets\ncriteria?) then (yes)
  :Export to ONNX;
  :Export to TorchScript;
else (no)
  :Adjust α, β, T;
  :Retrain Student;
endif

|Deployment|
:Register models in registry;
:Deploy Student as default;
:Keep Teacher for selective inference;
stop

note right
  Training infrastructure:
  - Modal serverless GPU
  - GCS for datasets
  - MLflow for tracking
end note

@enduml
